# Implementation plan — Spec 1.11.2

## Summary

Fix platform shell navigation when hopping between **Data** and **Email** satellites, and unify the platform loading overlay on page refresh (single overlay, label updates in place).

See [02-cross-service-nav-fix.md](./02-cross-service-nav-fix.md), [03-loading-overlay-unification.md](./03-loading-overlay-unification.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.11.2` |
| Services | Identity + WebOnOne + Data + Email running for manual test |
| New env | Data FE: `VITE_EMAIL_ORIGIN`; Email FE: `VITE_DATA_ORIGIN` |
| Packages | No build chain changes |

---

## Phase 1 — Data → Email outbound nav

**Goal:** Clicking Email sentinels on Data triggers auth-code redirect to Email.

**Exit criteria:** Data `/tags` → Email Templates lands on Email `/templates`.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Peer config | `data/frontend/src/features/email/utils/emailConfig.ts` |
| Redirect options | `data/frontend/src/features/email/utils/redirectToEmail.ts` |
| AppLayout handlers | `data/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx` — `handleEmailNavClick`, attach `onClick` via `isEmailNavSentinel` |
| Env example | `data/frontend/.env.example` — add `VITE_EMAIL_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3004` |

**Reference:** `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/email/utils/redirectToEmail.ts`, `identity/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx` `withEmailNavAction`

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w data-root`

---

## Phase 2 — Email → Data outbound nav

**Goal:** Clicking Data sentinels on Email triggers auth-code redirect to Data.

**Exit criteria:** Email `/templates` → Data Tags lands on Data `/tags`.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Peer config | `email/frontend/src/features/data/utils/dataConfig.ts` |
| Redirect options | `email/frontend/src/features/data/utils/redirectToData.ts` |
| AppLayout handlers | `email/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx` — `handleDataNavClick`, attach `onClick` via `isDataNavSentinel` |
| Env example | `email/frontend/.env.example` — add `VITE_DATA_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3005` |

**Reference:** `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/data/utils/redirectToData.ts`

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w email-root`

---

## Phase 3 — Unified loading overlay (delta)

**Goal:** One viewport overlay on refresh; label updates without remount ([03-loading-overlay-unification.md](./03-loading-overlay-unification.md)).

**Exit criteria:** Refresh Data `/tags` or Email `/templates` — no double full-screen spinner.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Loading context | `data/frontend/src/features/auth/context/PlatformLoadingContext.tsx` (mirror in email) — add `useRouteLoading`, `useLayoutEffect` |
| AppLayout | Single overlay when session **or** route **or** page loading; stable overlay `key` |
| LazyRoute | Suspense fallback reports `Loading page…` via context (no visible fallback) |
| List/home pages | `usePlatformLoading(label)` instead of `LoadingState overlay` |
| Cleanup | Remove redundant `PlatformHandoffSpinner` early returns on list pages |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w data-root` · `npm run type-check -w email-root`

---

## Cross-service integration

- Auth-code flow unchanged: `POST {identityApi}/auth/code` → peer home URL with `code`, `return_url`, `core_nav`
- Theme params: `relayThemeQueryParams(searchParams)` on outbound redirect
- `returnUrl` on peer hop: current satellite origin + `/` (consumer home — same as WebOnOne outbound)

